{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_02",
  "title": "Outpost Rebellion",
  "storyCode": "TW-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c2c2b09ff0400bc56670d056dffdc4ed5f973d7a24c9835a3358b7adfb13b6c9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 2上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:59 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nNomadic Town Wolumonde, Infected Quarter, Zwölftontechnik Strasse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Folinic... Are you angry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "The way they were acting, I know what it means. I know it all too well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "But... But Atro wouldn't get herself into trouble. She knows Leithanien better than any of us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Yeah! I'm sure she's fine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "At least, I hope..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_065",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Isn't this place eerily quiet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Yes. Stay close."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I'm seeing plenty of Infected among the citizenry, but that's not the main point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I was thinking about it when we fought those rioters before. This residential district is pretty ordinary in design, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "They've just gathered up all the Infected to live together. There's nothing explicitly discriminatory about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "But the truth is they're still having their personal freedom restricted. And aside from a few remarkable Infected, most people live more or less like prisoners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "What they have is not a prison, but an entire street of cells with a dozen times more inmates."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Look here, how long do you think it's been since this bakery was open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Ew... I think I saw an Originium slug crawling around... so unsanitary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "No one's been sweeping up the dust and leaves around the door. There's no functioning economy here. No daily life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I understand they've fallen on hard times, but no one wants to buy or sell bread? There's no public transit? This isn't normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Maybe, maybe it's because of what happened before? Like the shop owner got scared off or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "At least they have the right to live, they—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Shh! Miss Folinic...! Lower your voice!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I wasn't criticizing them. I was just talking about... those 'armed Infected.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Do you think they're..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "That policeman mentioned 'Sarkaz.' We need to look into that first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "If they do have anything to do with the 'armed Infected groups' we know, we'll have to tread carefully. Things here may be far more complicated than that policeman knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "If the Infected are living well enough, it's only because the situation isn't desperate enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "They must be hiding something from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Folinic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Please don't worry. Atro is very smart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "You've been looking very scary since that meeting. But don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "As long as we try really, really hard, we'll be able to handle this, just like the senior operators!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "So can you relax for me? At least a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Aw, is little Lisa comforting me again? Why's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Hehe, let go of all your troubles, big and small!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctors, please wait a moment—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "It's you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Didn't I say we don't need any help? All we need is access..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I know you said as much, Miss Folinic, but considering the circumstances, and your unfamiliarity with this place, we have to take precautions to guard against potential accidents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "...Miss Folinic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Fine... The locals may be more welcoming if we have one of their own with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's true! *Cough cough*! Zwölftontechnik Strasse was once Wolumonde's biggest Infected quarter..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "And now, for certain reasons, it's become Wolumonde's number one protest district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then what do you plan to do now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't think it's wise to go any deeper into this place... But if you want to learn more about the situation in Wolumonde, that is a good choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Let's just go for a stroll here. No need to rush things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "I'd be very happy if you were willing to tell me more about Dr. Atro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... really worry about Dr. Atro, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "We went to school together. And she is one of my very few trusted friends. Not to mention an employee Rhodes Island can't afford to lose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah, please come this way. Schaukelplatz is just up ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "What was Atro doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... Treating the local Infected, giving psychological counseling to those who were suffering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wolumonde was unable to avoid the Great Rift because of an error the Catastrophe Messengers made, and we suffered immensely for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dr. Atro could have left, but she decided to stay. After Wolumonde moored here, she set up a temporary medical facility to better serve the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dr. Atro... is their hero."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "...She was just doing what she had to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "She's always been better at practical work than rote learning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Heh. I can see her face right now, looking so self-satisfied. That's Atro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is the first time you've smiled since coming to Wolumonde."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "You've been pretty scary all day long, Folinic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "There's... a lot of people up ahead. Is that where everyone is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Shouldn't you do something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Peaceful assembly isn't a crime. That alone isn't grounds to detain them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're looking this way..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_065",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "Why is everyone quiet all of a sudden?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "No, this isn't right... Who's that talking to them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "Behind them, in the very back, there's—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
